{"title":"Sakura Blossom","slug":"Sakura_Blossom","pageid":1118,"revid":13577,"timestamp":"2024-07-03T08:30:47Z","lastEditor":"Gremlin231","categories":["Limited","Items","Event_Items"],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Shop","value":"The Oak Depot"},{"label":"Price","value":"$1400"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.3.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"10/2/2023"},{"label":"Status","value":"Unobtainable"},{"label":"Function","value":"Decoration"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"v-1-54-0","text":"V 1.54.0"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n<p><i><big>\"The perfect gift!\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>This item was obtainable during 2023 Valentines Event and was sold in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Oak_Depot/\">The Oak Depot</a> for $1400.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"v-1-54-0\">V 1.54.0</h2>\n\n<p><br>\nThe <b>Sakura Blossom</b> can be found in the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flowering_Meadows/\">Flowering Meadows</a> regions in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Sakura/\">Sakura</a> tree. It can be sold to <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Jer_Junkman/\"><b>Jer Junkman</b></a> for 350$ per Sakura Blossom. It can be turned into Dye by using a <b><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Press_Machine/\">Press Machine</a></b>.\n</p>\n\n</div>"}
